<div style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #111827;">
  <h2 style="color:#16a34a;">Your Case Meeting Was Updated</h2>

  <p>Dear {{citizenName}},</p>

  <p>
    Your lawyer
    <strong>{{lawyerName}}</strong>
    has updated the details of an upcoming meeting for your case on
    <strong>LawRoute</strong>.
  </p>

  <p><strong>Updated meeting details:</strong></p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Date:</strong> {{date}}</li>
    <li><strong>Time:</strong> {{time}}</li>
    <li><strong>Method:</strong> {{method}}</li>
    {{#if location}}
      <li><strong>Location:</strong> {{location}}</li>
    {{/if}}
  </ul>

  <p>
    Please log in to LawRoute to review these changes and prepare for your
    meeting.
  </p>

  <p>
    <a
      href="{{loginUrl}}"
      style="display:inline-block;padding:8px 14px;background:#16a34a;color:white;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;"
    >Review on LawRoute</a>
  </p>

  <p style="color:#6b7280;margin-top:18px;">Thanks,<br />The LawRoute Team</p>

  <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #e6e6e6;margin:18px 0;" />

  <p style="color:#9ca3af;font-size:12px;">©
    {{currentYear}}
    LawRoute. All rights reserved.</p>
</div>